        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f8dc2a26-342e-471f-a683-f36b43485f23).Image",
        "Description": "47 - the police force of the Vermont suburb of Whittleton Creek has been infiltrated by some members of a far-right paramilitary force looking to cause disruption and enforce dangerous, extremist policies. We need you to eliminate their ringleader, Daren Swart, and make it look like an accident so they don&apos;t use try to use this hit as propaganda against us. Also, get rid of his number two, Fermin Delvecchio, and his paramilitary contact, Larry Creed. And all as cleanly and quietly as you can.",
